# WebOrb

> WebOrb is a UK web design studio building custom, high-performance websites
> for ambitious businesses. Strategy, design, development, and local SEO —
> all under one roof, delivered in two weeks.

## About

WebOrb is a small, focused studio with 50+ delivered projects. We build
custom websites for businesses that care how they show up online — from
local trades and service companies to e-commerce stores and professional
services firms. No outsourcing. No junior handoffs. You deal directly with
the people building your site.

## Services

- **Web Design & Development**: Custom-built websites — hand-coded, Webflow,
  or Shopify. Includes design, copywriting, development, contact forms,
  hosting setup, and on-page SEO. Delivered in 2 weeks.
- **Local SEO**: Rank where it matters. Keyword optimisation, Google Maps
  visibility, on-page SEO, and monthly ranking reports.
- **Google Business Profile**: Setup, optimisation, review strategy — the
  details that build trust before anyone visits your site.
- **Google Ads & Landing Pages**: High-performance landing pages paired with
  targeted ad campaigns. Conversion tracking and A/B testing included.

## Templates

Ready-made website templates for UK tradespeople from £49. Choose a design,
we customise it with your details — live in 3 days.

## Pricing

- **Starter**: £799 one-off or £79/month — 5-page website, mobile-optimised,
  basic on-page SEO, contact form.
- **Growth** (most popular): £1,499 one-off or £149/month — 10 pages, full
  Local SEO campaign, Google Business Profile, 3 months support.
- **Pro**: Custom pricing — everything in Growth plus Google Ads management,
  monthly SEO management, priority support, quarterly strategy calls.

